{
  "sn54.6:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 54.6 ",
  "sn54.6:0.2": "1. Ekadhammavagga ",
  "sn54.6:0.3": "Ariṭṭhasutta ",
  "sn54.6:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn54.6:1.2": "Tatra kho bhagavā …pe… etadavoca: ",
  "sn54.6:1.3": "“bhāvetha no tumhe bhikkhave, ānāpānassatin”ti? ",
  "sn54.6:1.4": "Evaṁ vutte, āyasmā ariṭṭho bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn54.6:1.5": "“ahaṁ kho, bhante, bhāvemi ānāpānassatin”ti. ",
  "sn54.6:1.6": "“Yathā kathaṁ pana tvaṁ, ariṭṭha, bhāvesi ānāpānassatin”ti? ",
  "sn54.6:1.7": "“Atītesu me, bhante, kāmesu kāmacchando pahīno, anāgatesu me kāmesu kāmacchando vigato, ajjhattabahiddhā ca me dhammesu paṭighasaññā suppaṭivinītā. ",
  "sn54.6:1.8": "So satova assasissāmi, satova passasissāmi. ",
  "sn54.6:1.9": "Evaṁ khvāhaṁ, bhante, bhāvemi ānāpānassatin”ti. ",
  "sn54.6:2.1": "“‘Atthesā, ariṭṭha, ānāpānassati, nesā natthī’ti vadāmi. ",
  "sn54.6:2.2": "Api ca, ariṭṭha, yathā ānāpānassati vitthārena paripuṇṇā hoti ",
  "sn54.6:2.3": "taṁ suṇāhi, sādhukaṁ manasi karohi; bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
  "sn54.6:2.4": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho āyasmā ariṭṭho bhagavato paccassosi. ",
  "sn54.6:2.5": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn54.6:3.1": "“Kathañca, ariṭṭha, ānāpānassati vitthārena paripuṇṇā hoti? ",
  "sn54.6:3.2": "Idha, ariṭṭha, bhikkhu araññagato vā rukkhamūlagato vā suññāgāragato vā nisīdati pallaṅkaṁ ābhujitvā ujuṁ kāyaṁ 